  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Land Titling  Registry Modernization</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="ES">Titulacin y Modernizacin del Registro</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">THE PROGRAM AIMS AT CONTRIBUTING TO THE CONSOLIDATION OF A DYNAMIC, TRANSPARENT AND OPEN LAND MARKET IN RURAL AND URBAN AREAS. FOUR COMPONENTS MAKE UP THE PROGRAM: (A) RURAL WASTELAND TITLING; (B) URBAN REAL STATE TITLING; (C) REGISTER AND CADASTRE MODERNIZATION; (D) ENVIRONMENT PROTECTION IN RURAL AREAS.</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="ES"></narrative>
  </description>
